{"model":"qwen2.5-coder:7b","created_at":"2026-10-08T09:40:29.1634689Z","response":"```python\nimport re\n\ndef _is_ansi_code(char):\n    return re.match(r'[\\x1b@-Z\\\\-_]', char) is not None\n\ndef _is_ansi_sequence(text):\n    ansi_pattern = re.compile(r'\\x1b[@-Z\\\\-_]|\\x1b\\[[0-?]*[ -/]*[@-~]')\n    return bool(ansi_pattern.match(text))\n```","done":true,"done_reason":"stop","total_duration":1887293200,"load_duration":4189500,"prompt_eval_count":597,"prompt_eval_cached_count":483,"prompt_eval_duration":55138000,"eval_count":91,"eval_duration":1826120000}